{attrib, output=false, tags=pwd_entered }

{x_keyboard
    {message
        output={@
The keyboard is a thin glass plate with keys etched into it.
You can type using:
type
followed by the text you want to enter.

        }
    }
}

{bad_pass
    {message
        output={@
After you type your input into the keyboard...
Nothing happens.

        }
    }
}

{good_pass
    {message
        output={@
<?[room]((pwd_entered)) = 'false'?>
You type 'hplpkd5' into the keyboard and hit Enter.
A list of files fills the large screen before you.
They are all encrypted except for one. When you select it using the keyboard's
arrow keys and hit Enter a blueprint of the building unfolds before you.
It rapidly moves your perspective up through the floors until it arrives
at the 80th floor. There is a red blinking indicator within a square labeled:

Video Game Cabinet.

<else>
On the screen before you is a blueprint for the 80th floor.
There is a red blinking indicator within a square labeled:

Video Game Cabinet.

</?>
        }
    }

    {set, logic=[room]((pwd_entered)), output=true }
}











{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_keyboard))
    {act, logic=x_keyboard, tags=!_type|room }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((type_comm_badpwd))
    {act, logic=bad_pass, tags=!_type|room }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((type_comm_pwd))
    {act, logic=good_pass, tags=!_type|room }
}
